  "details": "System: Bazzite (KDE Plasma), AMD Ryzen 9 3900X, Nvidia RTX 3060 Ti (nvidia-open 610.43.03)\n\nLaunch options: -enable-avpro-in-proton -popupwindow\n\nReproduced identically on: GE-Proton (Wine 11.0-Staging), Proton Experimental, Proton RTSP 11.0\n\nAlready ruled out: GPU drivers (confirmed loaded via nvidia-smi), Steam overlay, Discord overlay, WINEESYNC=0/WINEFSYNC=0, raised thread/process limits (ulimit -u), VRChat local cache wipe, completely fresh Proton prefix, no mods/mod loaders installed\n\nCrash: EXCEPTION_ACCESS_VIOLATION reading address 0x8 inside ntdll.dll, consistently during world/avatar load, always immediately preceded by a large burst of RtlGrowFunctionTable calls and a loader_section critical-section timeout warning (RtlpWaitForCriticalSection ... loader.c: loader_section wait timed out).\n\nLog:",
